# Nothing PHP ships. There is no PHP runtime on Vercel, so a .php file inside
# the deployment would be served as readable source — and a file on disk beats a
# rewrite, so it would also shadow the /trade_handler.php route back into that
# bug. The repo no longer contains any .php file; this keeps it that way if one
# ever reappears.
*.php

# Not part of the deployed site. db/schema.sql in particular is documentation of
# the live schema and must never be web-served.
db/
docs/
tests/
MVP.md
README.md
.claude/

# The v3 concept preview is REPO-ONLY. It was built alongside the shipping app
# so the app and website could stay untouched while a redesign was tried, and a
# concept carrying invented sample figures has no business being reachable on
# the live marketing domain — noindex kept it out of search, but the URL still
# answered 200 to anyone who typed it. The source stays in git; it just stops
# being part of the deployment.
v3/
